  * frontend module: Add format_entry_or_fallback function
  * Add support for Windows
  * CLI interface: Support specifying multiple files on apply-theme and generate-data-hierarchy commands
  
  Improvements and bug fixes:
  * frontend module: Optimize language detection process
  * CLI interface: Rename generate-data-hierarchy command to generate-data (the original command can still be used)
  * Fix some grammar and spelling errors in output messages

